    <guid isPermaLink="false">661164234f66d1c1da5cd64c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 07 Apr 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Lucy金露姐是深圳一家二手奢侈品店老板，各种爱马仕香奈儿迪奥名牌包包手表珠宝都能在她这里出售及寄卖。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她跨行进入二奢行业，花了几年时间从小白到成为专家。如果你也在关注二奢的就业机会，或者你也考虑买二奢，欢迎来听听金姐的分享！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liu1ecVLMDlYt01wMIQoDQfTA3e0.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【时间轴】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="196">03:16</a> &nbsp;品牌是我的地基，让我找到拼搏的方向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="489">08:09</a> 二手奢侈品的商业模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="806">13:26</a>购买二手奢侈品的都是什么人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a>购买二奢如何避坑？如何识别真假包？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1285">21:25</a> 二手包/手表投资保值？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1535">25:35</a>和奢侈品是相互促进关系？提供情绪价值</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2025">33:45</a>非一般的包贩子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2348">39:08</a>用二手产品你能够接受吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2653">44:13</a> 如何从老板背刺的低谷中走出来？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【主播介绍】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>丽虹/欣陶：中国品牌全球化投资人，奇门遁甲传承人，杨公风水第三十九代传人，关注中国品牌全球化、女性成长、中国传统文化。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sandy：跨境互联网创业者，Party小能手，运动健身辣妹，链接、成长、突破。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【与我们互动】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>微信号：Stellaestbelle （欢迎添加微信一起交流）</span></p><span></span><p><span>即刻：中国女孩ChineseGirls播客</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：ChineseGirlsPod@outlook.com</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【加入听友群】</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fugr-Cevz31yC-dWrpzH_YcRbt8D.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
